WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.560
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.770
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:12.650
Refresh complete!

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:15.490
It was nice to have a mini-vacation.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:16.530
Yeah!

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.660
What's that sound?

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.500
Move it! Move it!

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.210
Sorry!

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.510
School festival?

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:38.140
Oh, it's almost here. Four Star Academy's school festival.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:45.560
There are all sorts of stalls and events, 
but this year's main event has got to be this!

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:49.610
The Broadway Dream show!

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:53.900
S4 will be taking part in their full glory too.

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:57.070
That sounds exciting.

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:59.580
I wanna see it! I'm definitely gonna be there! {this has happened before and I'm not going to check}{then I can it}

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.160
You've got it wrong, Yume-chan.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:05.670
Any student here can participate in the event.

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:08.540
What?! We can be in the show too?

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.090
That gets me going!

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:14.260
Nijino Yume, ready to apply!

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:59.070
This place is packed.

00:02:59.070 --> 00:02:59.990
Yeah.

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.450
Mahiru-chan! Ako-chan!

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:06.910
Well, look who it is.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:08.750
Are you looking to join too?

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:12.460
I'm a member of Theater Class. 
It's only natural for me to take part.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:17.510
As soon as Ako heard M4 was making a 
guest appearance, she could barely hold herself back.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:19.920
Don't tell them!

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:29.850
I'd like to begin the information session for the Broadway Dream show.

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:31.140
Thank you.

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:34.770
As part of a larger effort to improve relations during the school festival,

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:41.150
participation in this show will be open to all students regardless of year or class.

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:46.370
Students will comprise the entire cast and staff behind the show's production.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:49.540
So, in other words,

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:53.670
the stage direction, production, stage sets,

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:56.790
props, costumes, lighting, and sound—

00:03:56.790 --> 00:04:03.510
All of these backstage positions and more will be entirely filled by students.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:05.760
It's gonna be crazy tough!

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:10.430
Theater Class students are all knowledgeable about the workings of live plays.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:13.060
Ask us any questions you may have.

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:16.230
We'll be passing out scripts to those of you interested.

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:20.690
Cast and staff positions will be posted on KirakiLine. {pretty sure this is new}

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.650
That's all!

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:25.200
Let's all work hard together...

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:29.790
And show everyone a fantastic show! {I love it}{I don't}

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:30.830
Yes!

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:40.090
It's my first time making a stage from scratch. I can't contain my excitement!

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:42.470
The announcements are up.

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:43.550
You're right.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:47.050
Let's see, I got the position of...

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.720
SD Assistant?

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:54.060
Tsubasa-senpai is the stage director, so you're her assistant.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:58.520
The director's assistant... that sounds complicated.

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:00.820
I'm on props, and...

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:03.440
Show dancer Z?

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.030
Show dancer?

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:06.950
Koharu-chan?

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:12.950
Wh-What should I do? 
There's a dance number in here too.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:15.290
Can I really pull it off?

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:18.210
You'll need to buckle down and go for it.

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:20.840
Right!

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:23.590
Looking towards the Broadway Dream show...

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:26.970
Let's show 'em what we've got!

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:33.020
Rola, you're on sound, right? {audio?}

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:34.680
Yeah, that's right.

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:37.980
Mahiru's on makeup, and Ako is doing art.

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:41.730
Makeup's a bit of a specialty of mine, so I'm looking forward to this.

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:44.360
Does art mean you'll be working on the sets?

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:50.990
Yes. As a member of Theater Class, 
I'll be creating a set of the greatest quality...

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:54.870
What do I do? Can I do it?

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:59.040
What's up with Koharu?

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:01.250
What now? I've never done any of this before...

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:03.630
She's really feeling the pressure of being show dancer Z.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:07.010
Let's begin the rehearsal.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:09.300
We have with us the producer...

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:12.390
Me, Nikaidou Yuzu!

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:16.890
I'd like to start with the show dancer scene.

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:18.020
Okay!

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.900
Do the first run however you'd like.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.020
Right!

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:27.780
Th-The show is a one-night dream. {MISSED ONE BIATCH}

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:33.580
Atop its stage, you can put on any mask you'd like.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:35.370
Good, thanks.

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:39.210
Yuzu, how do you want to produce this?

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:44.460
She's a show dancer, so I'd like a more daring and sexy feel.

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:47.170
That's it! I've been inspired! {this might be Yuzu's thing but I'm not making it one quite yet}{can we have fewer things}{I don't control it!}

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:48.880
Prepare a chair.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:49.930
At once.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.430
Use this chair.

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:55.390
And just like this...

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:56.430
Line! {no, this is actually how it works when you're on stage.}

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:57.310
Huh?

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:02.940
I'll prepare a sexy song so that Koharu-chan can let out her daring side.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.070
U-Um...

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:06.360
As for your outfit...

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:08.440
How does this one look?

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:11.200
I-I couldn't possibly...

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:13.240
Let's get some sexy lighting on!

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:19.000
I know! We'll do you up in show-dancer makeup and see how it looks.{always lyger hyphens because, and also pretty sure this is "as preparation" and not "even though we are preparation"}

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.290
Ready! Start the music!

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:22.540
W-Wait...

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:24.540
Okay, here we go!

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:27.550
I-I, um...

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:32.550
I can't!

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:40.600
The show is a one-night dream.{this one is a regular hyphen}

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:49.150
Atop its stage, you can put on any mask you'd like.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.280
Nice, nice!

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.200
I had you all wrong, Koharu.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.160
K-Koharu-chan's unbelievable.

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:56.490
What a girl...

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:01.540
Follow our example and don't be afraid to offer up any ideas you may have.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:02.460
Yes!

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:07.210
Even the first day of rehearsal was incredible.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:11.010
The girls in S4 came up with idea after idea.

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:14.720
That must be what it means to make your own stage.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:19.850
Still, I wonder when Onee-chan and the others found the time to study.

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:25.520
They all had their own views of what to do with the show dancers, right?

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:26.860
Oh, yeah.

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:31.360
You can't create such a wealth of ideas without a deep knowledge of show production.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:33.860
Right, and that requires studying.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:37.370
I've gotta do my share too!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.370
There's <i>this</i> much?!

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:50.130
If we're committed to doing it, then we should do a thorough literature review.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.920
We can make it through together, Yume-chan.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:57.680
Honestly, if I really put my mind to it, 
then this mountain is but a molehill to me.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:01.350
Wow, they're all so beautiful.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:04.230
These show dancers get me going.

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:05.100
Me too!

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.770
Is this a dressing room?

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:11.360
Yeah, they're in these books too.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:18.070
Any movie about show dancers worth its salt has to have at least one backstage scene.

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:23.040
I guess it's because you wouldn't normally be able to see backstage, so it piques your curiosity.

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:27.420
The inner workings of the show...

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:31.340
Backstage?{...}

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:36.550
Yes! It came to me as I was 
researching show dancers in the library.

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:39.090
Behind-the-scenes stuff is so interesting!

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:45.100
I'm sure our audience wouldn't have seen anything like it before, so I'd like to include it somehow.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.600
How should we do that?

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:48.480
With this!

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.730
A video camera?{this is what they're called right}{I think it's kind of dying off in recent years maybe or I wasn't thinking}

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:55.690
Yes! I'll use it to film what goes on in the dressing room.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:58.950
We'll record what goes on backstage,{this comma is actually bad, but subtitles and lines and stuff}

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:01.740
and then play it just before the show.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:07.670
I get it. When we show it before the actual performance,

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:11.790
the audience will feel like they're getting a glimpse into what goes on backstage.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:12.670
Exactly!

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:16.630
This'll give people something to watch while they wait,

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:20.430
and it'll also build hype for the show itself.

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:24.930
I like your idea. Please go ahead with it.

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:27.180
Really?

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:32.940
Take charge of this plan and get it to work with the rest of the first-years.

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:36.110
You can count on me!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:54.630
We should probably figure out what kind of scenes to include before doing any filming.

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:59.630
How about a scene where someone is putting on lipstick and makeup in front of a mirror?

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:05.850
In my opinion, seeing the dancers relax before taking the stage would be interesting.

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:10.890
Who's going to to act in all of these scenes?

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:18.150
I've already got three people in mind, 
all the very definition of cool and sexy. {she wouldn't say this [in my mind]}

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:21.660
Three cool and sexy people?

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:23.570
If you would!

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:25.280
If you would!

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:27.620
If you would!

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.160
You want me in this too?

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:32.080
Please do!

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:36.300
Show dancer backstage plan. {caps?}{not if yume is a good girl and does at least one thing the french way}

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:39.170
I want it to feel like a real show dancer dressing room,

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:43.760
so I compiled a list of props to include and sketched out the general flow.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:46.600
But I'm in charge of makeup...

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:48.890
Don't sweat the small things!

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:51.980
It makes Onee-chan so happy to be with Mahiru!

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:53.190
Stop that...

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:58.940
I like it. Even though it's a short scene, the audience should love it.

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:00.030
I hope so!

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:02.820
Should we start by building the dressing room set?

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:03.660
Sure!

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:14.960
There! Next, I'll take another like this one and... perfect!

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:14.080
Koharu-chan! Could you grab a small hand mirror from the props?

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.290
Sure, got it.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:22.220
Hand mirror, hand mirror...

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.260
Asahi-senpai?!

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:30.640
U-Um, I—Please excuse me!

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:32.430
I'll come back later!

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:37.020
It's fine, don't worry. 
You came to find a prop, right?

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:39.690
Yes.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:48.990
Um, what brings you here, Asahi-senpai?

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:54.210
The umbrella we were going to use for the show broke.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:58.460
I'm looking for a replacement, 
but none of them really work.{by the way I don't think we've ever talked about this but we don't do the "none is always singular" thing right}{depends on the sentence structure}

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:00.550
They don't fit my outfit.

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.930
There, all fixed.

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:14.100
Wow, it's just like new!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.940
Thanks, you're a lifesaver. {uh, yeah, that's what I meant. Just forgot.}

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:18.440
Glad to have helped.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:23.990
You're a first-year in Beauty Class, right? I think you were Mahiru's friend.

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.450
Your name is...

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:27.780
Hand mirror!

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:32.700
Oh no, I need to hurry! We're going to start filming soon!

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:35.830
Found it! Please excuse me!

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.630
Wait, your name...{she told you, it's hand mirror}

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:46.090
Welcome, one and all!

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:47.380
This is!

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:51.850
The Four Star Academy School Festival! {just realized that this could nix the school part}{nope, the school part is important}

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:54.850
It's a day you'll never forget!

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:59.350
The main event will be the Broadway Dream show, with S4 at its center!

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.440
Ah, it's Yume-chan!

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:01.440
Nico-chan! Coco-chan! {they've never said Coco's name iirc, but I remember at the start wanting to spell it like this}{coco coco co?}

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:04.490
Thanks for inviting us to your school festival!

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:07.700
Sure. You girls go have fun today.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.360
Okay!

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:13.120
It's been quite a while, Nijino Yume-san.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.620
You two decided to come too?

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:21.500
Four Star Academy is famous for the high quality of its festival shows.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.840
Isn't that right, Naho-san?

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.590
Of course, Ayumi-san.

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:27.760
We couldn't possibly miss this opportunity.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:30.970
Come and check out our show too if you'd like.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.260
I will, in fact.

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:34.010
Thank you, Yume-san.

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:37.020
We're here to see you, Yume-chan.

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:38.770
Sure is bustling.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:40.850
Dad, Mom!

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:42.940
This is a splendid campus.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:47.900
We've heard all about it from Yume-chan, 
but this is our first time seeing it ourselves.

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:49.030
Is it?

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:54.540
It is! You even went to the 
matriculation alone with Koharu-chan.

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:58.910
So what time does your show start?{I think "show you're in" at least somewhat implies acting in it}

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.290
Tonight at six.

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:06.050
But be sure to come a bit early, because we've got something special planned.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:08.550
Here's the flyer.{apparently there are some people who feel very strongly about flier/flyer nuances}{we've talked about this before}

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:11.640
I can hardly wait.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:18.100
Rola?

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:24.020
We can't use the projector?

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:29.900
No, and we were planning to use it for the 
footage we made with Yume before the show.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:31.450
Excuse me!

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.320
Excuse me!

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:34.370
Yume!

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:37.200
Nijino.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.660
There's been an equipment failure.

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:43.080
Aw man.

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:46.380
Then why don't we just get another projector?

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:50.630
I asked around, but it doesn't look like we can get one in time.

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:55.600
But I don't want to waste all the effort you girls put into this.

00:15:55.600 --> 00:16:00.730
Neither do I. You all worked so hard for this.

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:06.060
All right! We'll make this happen no matter what!

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:07.270
Right.

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:09.070
If we can't show a recording...

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:14.110
If we can't show a recording, 
how about we do it live on stage?

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:15.530
On stage?

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:18.330
We'll do all the things we had recorded on stage,

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:22.000
almost as if we're giving the audience a glimpse into the dressing room.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:27.290
It does sound like something we can get ready in time.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.840
Tsubasa, Mahiru, what do you think?

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:31.130
I'm for it.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.380
We can do this.

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:37.470
But even a short scene will put a large burden on the staff.

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:40.600
Still, we've got no choice but to overcome this together!

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:41.640
Yeah!

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:46.520
Good. Let's make use of every 
second we've got until showtime.{wow, it's literally going to be showtime—I miss johnny}

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:48.650
Yeah!

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:03.210
It's supposed to be backstage, 
so tone down the lights a touch.

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:04.160
Okay.

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:09.170
This bare-bones set is the best we 
could do, but please make use of it.{my opinion of you has gone down like 30 points}{wow, me too}

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:13.170
Great! Yeah, it looks good!

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.680
That was on point.

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:22.810
Yeah.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.310
What do you think, Yume?

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:26.140
It's perfect!

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:27.310
Still...

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:34.190
Let's do it one last time from the top.

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:35.150
Okay.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:53.170
It's time for the show.

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:55.510
I'm so nervous.

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.430
You can do this, Koharu.

00:17:57.430 --> 00:18:01.680
We made this stage with our 
own hands. Now let's light it on fire!

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:02.930
Right!

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:13.820
Here we go!

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:16.610
Aikatsu!

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:41.390
It looks like a dressing room.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:43.310
This production is intriguing.

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:50.690
Everyone, five minutes until showtime. Please go on standby.

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:51.730
Yes!

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:58.320
Before the show begins, we have a few announcements for our guests.

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:05.660
Audio and video recording of the show is strictly prohibited.

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:09.870
Please turn off your phones.

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:14.540
In addition, eating, drinking, and smoking is not allowed in the theater.

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:15.000
Let's put on the best show we can!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:19.880
The show will begin momentarily. Please enjoy it until the end.

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:16.380
Yeah!

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:29.390
Curtain standby.

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:34.270
Five, four, three, two...

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:35.270
Start!

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:25.410
Pardon me!

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:27.160
You okay?

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.660
Subaru-kyun?!

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:30.620
Hurry the costume change.

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:31.540
Okay!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:34.290
Whoa, is she for real?

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:43.380
She's your friend, right?

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:44.890
Yeah, so?

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:46.800
She's nothing like what I took her for!

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:49.350
Well, she does seem meek most of the time.

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:50.270
What's her name?

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:52.430
Nanakura Koharu.

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:55.400
Koharu... I'll remember that!

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:56.810
Huh, why?

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:42.480
Bravo! Bravo!

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:44.070
Yume!

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:54.540
The show is a one-night dream.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:59.830
Many people work together to create a single dream.

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:01.710
And that makes the stage!

00:23:58.200 --> 00:23:59.910
The school festival is over.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:04.250
And unbelievably, this is the last week of Four Star Academy News.

00:24:04.250 --> 00:24:08.510
Starting next week, we'll have a new segment to introduce our dresses. {please be more like aphorism than the S4 thing}

00:24:08.510 --> 00:24:10.130
Look forward to it!

00:24:10.720 --> 00:24:13.260
Lily-senpai's back at the academy!

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:14.760
And she's already about to collapse?!

00:24:14.760 --> 00:24:18.010
I'm going to learn everything I can from Senpai's Aikatsu!

00:24:18.010 --> 00:24:20.520
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.520 --> 00:24:21.980
An Unstealable Dream.{I would prefer something like "a dream that no one can take away" if our aikatsu practices didn't preclude titles with words}

00:24:21.980 --> 00:24:23.980
Become the first-star idol!
